    description: Version 1.0.0.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
abstract: >-
  Multigroup neutron diffusion solvers for 1-D slab, cylinder and sphere
  geometries, 2-D structured XY and RZ meshes, and 2-D unstructured polygonal
  meshes: k-eigenvalue, fixed-source and time-dependent problems, with delayed
  neutrons. The solvers are written in C++17 and exposed to Python through
  pybind11; the Python package adds cross-section builders, mesh and core
  layout tools, post-processing, and a discretization-error estimator based on
  the method of nearby problems.
keywords:
  - neutron diffusion
  - reactor physics
  - k-eigenvalue
  - reactor kinetics
  - finite volume
  - unstructured mesh
